#. module: l10n_ca_ns_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_ns_payroll.source_t4127_123
msgid ""
"2026 Nova Scotia brackets and constants KP and basic personal amount. The "
"edition lists Nova Scotia among the provinces without change on July 1, "
"2026, and announces no Nova Scotia change for January 1, 2027."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_ns_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_ns_payroll.source_workers_compensation_regulations
msgid ""
"Assessable payroll: the employment earnings of box 14 of the T4 slips. "
"Maximum earnings: 135.7% of the average industrial wage for Nova Scotia of "
"the 12 months ending March 31 of the previous year, rounded to the nearest "
"100. Assessable payroll reported and assessments remitted at the same time "
"as the remittances to the CRA, unless the Board approves otherwise."
msgstr ""

